# W9: `session_titles: false` (the `/settings` row's off). No title request is
# sent -- the gateway log and the bodies have none -- and the session keeps the
# title its first prompt gives it, in the window, the status line and the
# `/resume` picker. The fake would answer one with titles-answer.json.
gateway titles-turns.json
titled titles-answer.json
seed titles-off-seed.json
xfx: env XFX_SOUND=off
wait 3
type fix the renderer loop, it redraws every row twice
key Enter
wait 4
snap answered
title answered
type /new
key Enter
wait 2
type /resume
key Enter
wait 2
snap resume
gwlog
